  "abstract": "Add small priors to learned horizon weights \u03b3[t]: monotonicity penalty and slope smoothness. Base config p=36, H=160, drop=0.05, Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124. Hypothesis: priors yield more stable late-horizon emphasis and slight MAE gains over 0.026125.",
